🔐 Auth
POST /auth/register
POST /auth/login
GET /auth/me
👤 Users
GET /users/{id} → ver perfil
GET /users/{id}/posts → posts de un usuario
PUT /users/{id} → actualizar perfil
🤝 Follows
POST /follow/{user_id} → seguir
DELETE /follow/{user_id} → dejar de seguir
GET /users/{id}/followers
GET /users/{id}/following
📝 Posts
POST /posts → crear post
GET /posts/{id} → ver post
DELETE /posts/{id} → eliminar post
GET /feed → feed del usuario autenticado
❤️ Likes
POST /likes/{post_id} → dar like
DELETE /likes/{post_id} → quitar like
GET /posts/{post_id}/likes
💬 (Opcional) Comentarios
POST /comments/{post_id}
GET /posts/{post_id}/comments
DELETE /comments/{id}
